@title Cabinet plate: EMC view says how many wires with no duct route are left out
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1920x1080
# With the vertical duct removed some wires have no duct route; the plate view leaves them out and the legend says so.
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text open emc example
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc view on the plate
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
click 887 195
wait 10
key Delete
wait 30
shot plate-emc-left-out
expect "left out of this view"
check_layout
